  "content": "<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1157/728/elemental_wizards_banner-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1565\">🧙&zwj;♂️🌊⛰️🌪️掌握元素之力，战胜你的敌人！</h1>\n<h4><strong>RPG系列“巫师”的3个新元素巫师子职业（土、水、风）扩展包</strong></h4>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/loader-fabric-black?style=for-the-badge&labelColor=black&color=grey\" alt=\"\" width=\"146\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252felemental-wizards-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/modrinth-black?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&labelColor=black&color=grey\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fAShKd5XrTu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1209063880790376468?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=discord&labelColor=black&color=grey\" alt=\"\" width=\"194\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffichteee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/donations-black?style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi&labelColor=black&color=grey\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/ProfessorFichte/Elemental-Wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/github-black?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=black&color=grey\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📂 安装说明</h2>\n<h4><strong>🚨必需模组</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" rel=\"nofollow\">法术引擎 (Spell Engine)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-rpg-classes\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多RPG职业库 (More RPG Library)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/azurelib-armor\" rel=\"nofollow\">Azure Lib Armor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards\" rel=\"nofollow\">巫师 (RPG系列)</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><strong>👍强烈推荐模组</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/daedelus_dev/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">整个RPG系列项目</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-rpg-jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">额外RPG饰品 (Additional RPG Jewelry)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-n-explore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">战利品与探索 (Loot &amp; Explore) </a>&amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lne-wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LNE巫师</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>🕹️ 功能特色</h2>\n<h3>✨ 法术</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>利用不同的元素巫师法术，让战斗更加有趣。</li>\n<li>水元素巫师是一个半辅助与治疗型的巫师，但他也能造成可观的伤害！</li>\n<li>土元素巫师是一个坦克型控制法师，擅长持续伤害，非常难以被击杀。</li>\n<li>风元素巫师是一个高强度控制职业，依赖于击退和击浮连招。</li>\n<li>通过装备带有绑定法术池的法术书或使用带有绑定法术的武器，你可以施放这些法术。</li>\n<li>要制作法术书，请寻找或制作法术绑定台！你需要一本书&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/578/spell_binding_e_wizards-png.png\" alt=\"法术池\" width=\"800\" height=\"300\"></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>🤺 战斗与装备</p>\n<ul>\n<li>为气、土和水元素制作新的法杖和魔杖！</li>\n<li>制作元素符文，施法时需要用到它们。</li>\n<li>建议使用 Better Combat 以获得最佳体验！</li>\n<li>武器、护甲和法术都利用了气、土和水法术强度。<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/591/elemental_wizards-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"300\"></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h4>🤝<strong>集成</strong> <strong>模组兼容性</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterEnd</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterNether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-essence\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rune Essence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zephyr\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zephyr</a> 感谢 MuonR 提供的兼容支持！</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>⚙️ 配置选项</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>护甲与武器加成：</strong></li>\n<li>_config/elemental_wizards_rpg/items.json</li>\n<li><strong>状态效果数值：</strong></li>\n<li>_config/elemental_wizards_rpg/effects.json</li>\n<li><strong>战利品注入：</strong></li>\n<li>_config/rpg_series/loot.json</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h3>🎥 展示视频</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>感谢所有内容创作者展示我的模组😊！</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NXNDYmtoJIM?t=3s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Hi9ZpCR7UKo?t=423s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nfJhQBMwtWg?si=jrxx0REFXGeM52w9\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>🙌 致谢</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>Deadelus 创建了令人惊叹的法术引擎 API</li>\n<li>Damienbrittan 制作了超棒的模组横幅！</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果你想对本模组提供反馈或进行讨论，欢迎加入我的 Discord 服务器！:)</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/AShKd5XrTu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1209063880790376468?style=plastic&logo=discord&label=Discord&labelColor=black&color=blue&link=https://discord.gg/AShKd5XrTu\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"18\"></a></p>",
